OL,3,AGas is cut over unpaid bills despite
OL,4,Apayments made
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents at a block of flats in
OL,7,Fnorth-west London have been left
OL,8,Fwithout heating or hot water due to
OL,9,Fhistoric unpaid bills of #600,000,
OL,10,Fdespite monthly payments being made
OL,11,Fover several years.
OL,13,FAbout 126 homes have been affected
OL,14,Fsince 23 October. In a letter to
OL,15,Fresidents, the developer and buildings
OL,16,Fmanagement said about #300,000 is owed
OL,17,Fto the gas provider and #300,000 to the
OL,18,Felectricity provider.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
