OL,3,AGas is cut over unpaid bills despite
OL,4,Apayments made
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building's management company,
OL,7,FRendall & Rittner, said: "We fully
OL,8,Frecognise the seriousness of the
OL,9,Fsituation and the impact it is having
OL,10,Fon residents, particularly families and
OL,11,Fthose who may be vulnerable."
OL,13,FThe freeholder did not respond to a
OL,14,Frequest for comment from BBC London.
